printing.sizing_note = Nɔnɔme si doa ɖe teƒe me la ɖoa foto la ɖe grid ƒe xɔ ɖe sia ɖe me, eye wòlé eƒe kekeme kple didime ƒe sɔsɔ me, eye wometsãa eƒe akpa aɖeke ɖa o. Lolome si le nuŋlɔɖi ƒe DPI nu la metrɔa lolome o; ne foto la medo xɔ la me o la, ɖe grid ƒe fliwo alo sɔŋkɔwo me. Ta PDF la le 100% dzi, eye mègazã ɖoɖo si doa agbalẽ la ɖe axaɖe me o.
