printing.limit = Agbalẽtata-dɔ sia tso se la dzi: nɔnɔmetata 200, pixel miliɔn 40 alo pixel 32768 le axa ɖe sia ɖe dzi na nɔnɔmetata ɖe sia ɖe, alo PDF ƒe data si wotsi kɔ 256 MiB.
printing.profile_error = Nɔnɔmetata sia ƒe ama ƒe nɔnɔmedzesi mesɔ o, mesɔ ɖe nɔnɔmetata la ŋu o, alo womekpe ɖe eŋu o. CMYK/Lab amadede-mɔ si le nuŋlɔɖi la ŋutɔ me la hiã ama ƒe nɔnɔmedzesi si sɔ si le nuŋlɔɖi la me; RGB hã hiã RGB ama ƒe nɔnɔmedzesi.
printing.does_not_fit = Nɔnɔmetata la ƒe lolome le eƒe nuŋlɔɖi DPI nu medo xɔ sia me o. Zã nɔnɔme si doa eɖokui ɖe teƒe me, ɖe grid ƒe fliwo alo sɔŋkɔwo me, alo zã agbalẽ si lolo wu.
printing.caption_limit = Foto ƒe nuŋɔŋlɔ didi akpa ŋutɔ na grid sia. Ɖe fliwo alo sɔŋkɔwo me, ɖe nuŋɔŋlɔ la me, alo ɖe foto ƒe nuŋɔŋlɔwo ɖa.
printing.font_error = Ŋɔŋlɔdzesi aɖeke mele foto ƒe nuŋɔŋlɔ na o. Ɖo ŋɔŋlɔdzesi aɖe alo ɖe foto ƒe nuŋɔŋlɔwo ɖa.
printing.no_document = Ʋu nuŋlɔɖi aɖe alo tia foto siwo le gallery me hafi nàta.
printing.source_error = Womete ŋu xlẽ foto si wotia, eƒe tɔtrɔwo ƒe agbalẽvi si le egbɔ, alo foto ƒe nuŋɔŋlɔ o. Womedzra PDF aɖeke ɖo o.
printing.save_error = Womete ŋu dzra PDF la ɖo o. Tia agbalẽvi ƒe ŋkɔ yeye le agbalẽdzraɖoƒe si me woate ŋu aŋlɔ nu me; womenɔa asi agbalẽvi siwo li xoxo ŋu gbeɖe o.
